"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Canada's Prime Minister said he was reluctantly announcing retaliatory tariffs and accused the US of starting a trade war.\",            \"english_title\": \"Canada's Tariffs\",            \"translated_version\": \"El Primer Ministro de Canad\u00e1 dijo que estaba anunciando tarifas en respuesta y acus\u00f3 a Estados Unidos de comenzar una guerra comercial.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tarifas de Canad\u00e1\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The former defense minister has called for wartime elections to be held in Ukraine.\",            \"english_title\": \"Ukraine Elections\",            \"translated_version\": \"El exministro de defensa pidi\u00f3 que se hagan elecciones en tiempos de guerra en Ucrania.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Elecciones en Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Four people are still missing after Friday's attack which killed 16 and left 130 injured, including a number of children.\",            \"english_title\": \"Attack Aftermath\",            \"translated_version\": \"Cuatro personas todav\u00eda est\u00e1n desaparecidas despu\u00e9s del ataque del viernes que mat\u00f3 a 16 y dej\u00f3 a 130 heridos, incluyendo varios ni\u00f1os.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Despu\u00e9s del Ataque\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The latest incident comes days after reports emerged that Israel had struck a military airbase close to the Turkish border.\",            \"english_title\": \"Military Airbase Strike\",            \"translated_version\": \"El \u00faltimo incidente ocurre d\u00edas despu\u00e9s de que se informara que Israel atac\u00f3 una base a\u00e9rea militar cerca de la frontera con Turqu\u00eda.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque a Base A\u00e9rea\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A rescue worker said the site had been struck twice as civilians gathered for a meditation retreat.\",            \"english_title\": \"Meditation Retreat Attack\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un rescatista dijo que el lugar fue atacado dos veces mientras civiles se reun\u00edan para un retiro de meditaci\u00f3n.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque en Retiro de Meditaci\u00f3n\"        }    ]}"